      {
        "id": 17158,
        "title": "Aktualizacja zmiennych let",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak już widzieliśmy, zmienne <code>let</code>, w przeciwieństwie do <code>const</code>, mogą zmieniać i aktualizować przechowywane wartości.</p><p>Użyj znaku <code>=</code>, aby zmienić wartość w <code>playerState</code> z <code>\"Idle\"</code> na <code>\"Running\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145164,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy aktualizować zmienne <code>let</code> tak często, jak chcemy.</p><p>Wypróbuj samodzielnie: zmień wartość <code>playerState</code> na <code>\"Jumping\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jumping&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>playerState</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>\"Jumping\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145165,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy również przypisywać zmiennym wartości innych zmiennych, ustawiając jedną zmienną na wartość drugiej.</p><p>Przypisz zmiennej <code>playerState</code> wartość <code>defaultState</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" defaultState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = defaultState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>defaultState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdy aktualizujemy zmienną, zapomina ona swoją poprzednią wartość.</p><p>Wyświetl zmienną <code>playerState</code>, gdy ma wartość <code>\"Attacking\"</code>, oraz gdy ma wartość <code>\"Defending\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let playerState\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacking&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Defending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>playerState</code>, a następnie <code>playerState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która z tych linii kodu aktualizuje zmienną <code>playerHealth</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>playerHealth = 50;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let playerHealth = 50;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>playerHealth = 50;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Forest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelName</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>Forest</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co jest nie tak z tym kodem?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">W pierwszym wierszu brakuje słowa kluczowego <code>let</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nic</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">W pierwszym wierszu brakuje słowa kluczowego <code>let</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joe</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Lori</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>Joe</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmień wartość zmiennej <code>playerHealth</code> na <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let playerHealth\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zaktualizuj zmienną <code>gameState</code> na <code>\"Paused\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let gameState\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(gameState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>gameState</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, a potem <code>\"Paused\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zaktualizuj zmienną <code>hudText</code> na <code>\"Start\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Start\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let hudText\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Press any key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hudText);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>hudText</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, a potem <code>\"Start\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmień wartość zmiennej <code>gameState</code> na <code>\"GameOver\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"49\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(gameState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>\"GameOver\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17159,
        "title": "Wyrażenia tekstowe",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy łączyć wartości tekstowe za pomocą znaku <code>+</code>.</p><p>Dodaj do siebie wartości <code>\"Score:\"</code> i <code>\"55\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodawanie do siebie wartości tekstowych nazywamy <strong>wyrażeniem</strong>, ponieważ tworzy ono pojedynczą wartość tekstową.</p><p>Dodaj wyrażenie między nawiasami <code>console.log()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"Score:\"</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>\"55\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdy wyrażenia zawierają zmienne, używają wartości tych zmiennych.</p><p>Utwórz wyrażenie, które dodaje do siebie wartość <code>\"HP:\"</code> i zmienną <code>playerHealth</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerHealth;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"HP:\"</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możesz użyć <code>console.log()</code>, aby zobaczyć wyniki wyrażeń.</p><p>Dodaj instrukcję <code>console.log()</code> wokół wyrażenia.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>console.log</code>, następnie <code>(</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145179,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ponieważ wyrażenia stają się wartościami, możemy przypisywać je do zmiennych tak samo jak wartości.</p><p>Zapisz wyrażenie <code>\"Level:\" + \"13\"</code> w zmiennej <code>label</code> i wyświetl je w konsoli.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;13&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"Level:\"</code>, następnie <code>+</code>, a potem <code>\"13\"</code>, <code>label</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145180,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaka jest wartość <code>label</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Player:Rex\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Rex\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"Player:Rex\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145181,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Nic, ponieważ nie ma instrukcji <code>console.log()</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>GameOver</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nic, ponieważ nie ma instrukcji <code>console.log()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145182,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + enemyName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy:slime</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>slime</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>Enemy:slime</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dlaczego ten kod wyświetla w konsoli <code>GameStart</code> bez spacji?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Ponieważ <code>\"Game\" + \"Start\"</code> dodaje do siebie wartości bez spacji</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Ponieważ <code>console.log()</code> nigdy nie wyświetla spacji</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ponieważ <code>\"Game\" + \"Start\"</code> dodaje do siebie wartości bez spacji.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj zmienną <code>score</code> do wyrażenia.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;14&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145185,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl <code>Score:55</code> w konsoli.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>console.log</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, a potem <code>\"Score:\" + \"55\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145186,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
